OL,3,GNEWSARowdy Halloween party with 'drunk
OL,4,Ateens' shut down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rowdy Halloween house party with more
OL,7,Fthan 200 teenagers has been closed down
OL,8,Fby police after fireworks were set off
OL,9,Ftowards other houses.
OL,11,FLancashire Police said there was
OL,12,F"extremely loud music" and many of the
OL,13,Fchildren were drunk at the party at a
OL,14,Fproperty in Whittle-le-Woods.
OL,16,FThe force said it believed cannabis had
OL,17,Fbeen smoked and at one point the
OL,18,Fhomeowner barricaded the front door to
OL,19,Fstop more teenagers getting in.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
